  "description": "Foundational building blocks for .NET 8 and .NET 10: ArrayPool-backed buffer builders, a broad extension-method surface over strings, dates, numerics, spans, and enumerables, async threading primitives, text-encoding utilities, the calendar value sets (days of the week, months, days of the month, hours, minutes and seconds), and the ThrowHelper argument-validation catalogue the rest of the solution validates against. The specialized generic collection catalogue (circular buffer, deque, evicting dictionary, graphs, tries, and more) ships separately as Bodu.Collections.",
